  "card": "ConnectBlock is updated to route all script checking through CCheckQueue, removing a dedicated single-threaded verification path since CCheckQueue already runs checks synchronously on the calling thread when no worker threads exist. CheckInputScripts is stripped of its dual-use pvChecks output parameter and now only executes scripts inline, while script check generation for blocks is handled directly in ConnectBlock. The change also resolves a long-standing bug where block script caching during TestBlockValidity was bypassed when multithreading was enabled. The author highlights this cleanup as preparation for Schnorr batch verification work.",
